Subject: [PATCH] esp32c5: supply Bluetooth controller dependencies

Add the NPL headers required by the controller's mempool allocator and place
its fast paths in instruction RAM. Match the C5 Bluetooth clock/reset and
RNG setup, derive the low-power divider from the crystal, and preserve
shared coexistence clocks. Share the timer server and periodic PHY tracking
between both radios so BLE also works before Wi-Fi and after Wi-Fi stops.

